# anti-slop-pptx-kit Active Rules (v2.0)

1. **Ban Card-Grid Loops**: Max 1 card-grid slide per entire deck. Never stamp 3/4/6/7 identical boxes across consecutive slides. Rotate archetypes using `templates/pptxgenjs-studio-kit.mjs` or `templates/python_pptx_studio.py`.
2. **Ban Eyebrows & Repeated Chrome**: Never put `02 · SECTION`, `PASO 01`, `BLOQUEO X`, pill badges, or heading emojis (`🚀`, `✨`). Never repeat a full company/subtitle bar on every slide.
3. **Word Budget**: Max 35–50 words per narrative/visual slide (`6–14` words per text block), leaving 35–55% negative space.
4. **Typography & Color**: Ban `Inter`, `Arial`, `Calibri`, `Roboto`, `Space Grotesk`, `Geist`, and purple-blue gradients. Use 60-30-10 palettes + 4-step opacity ramps (`100%/60%/30%/10%`), 5x–10x scale contrast, and alternating dark/warm-off-white slides.
5. **Mandatory Verification**: Run `node scripts/audit-pptx-code.mjs .` (must exit 0) and inspect rendered PNGs before finishing.
